- [Slots catalog](https://spreecommerce.org/docs/developer/dashboard/slots-catalog) — every named slot the dashboard exposes
- [Custom Admin Endpoints](https://spreecommerce.org/docs/developer/sdk/admin/extending) — adding your own API endpoints
- [Creating an extension](https://spreecommerce.org/docs/developer/contributing/creating-an-extension) — the Rails-engine side

